  "implementation": [
    "Optional retirement/retirement-ack routes use existing immutable acceptance, publication/earned-credit authority and optional cleanup journal; no new schema or financial writer.",
    "One matching policy/profile/resource command and durable backoff reservation per poll; no hosted/native inference or R2 reads/writes.",
    "Separate two-phase owner outbox persists the command before native action and completed native reply before acknowledgement; audit completion recovery precedes new maintenance.",
    "Dedicated native cleanup_once only executes existing owned erasure/retirement steps and cannot fall through to queued inference.",
    "Saved completed acknowledgement replays without native assets/current policy; partial writes and conflicting commands remain preserved.",
    "Account deletion retains stronger pending erasure authority; retirement never acknowledges account deletion or changes accepted work/credit."
